WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:11.966
Take attendance for any class, on any day. Open the class and press Take attendance.

2
00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:23.346
Tap A for absent, L for late, or E for excused, and add a reason if you like.

3
00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:30.015
Then one tap marks everyone else present. It saves as you go.

4
00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:36.836
Month shows every day, each pupil's rate, and exports to Excel.

5
00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:41.015
Now arrange your day. Open Plan, then My day.

6
00:00:41.015 --> 00:00:52.313
Your periods come from your timetable. Add anything else: a relief class, a meeting, marking.

7
00:00:52.313 --> 00:01:02.759
Use the arrows or drag to put the day in your order, and tick items off as you go.

8
00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:07.712
Each period has Plan, Teach and Attendance one tap away. Next: watch "Your yearly plan".
